---
description: Prepare one releaseTraining evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: AdaptationTest[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Assemble the adapted program with facilitator notes, terminology, and documented limits of applicability. Obtain audience and instructional review, version the relationship to the source program, and avoid presenting one adaptation as universal for an entire culture. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
